{"title":"That was then, this is now, AI edition","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/922091549/0/marginalrevolution~That-was-then-this-is-now-AI-edition.html","date":1753302075000,"content":"<blockquote><p><strong>COWEN: </strong>They can now do <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://deepmind.google/discover/blog/ai-solves-imo-problems-at-silver-medal-level/\" target=\"_blank\">Math Olympiad problems</a>. There’s one forecast by someone working on this that, within a year, they’ll win Math Olympiads. It could be wrong, but when you say that it’s only a year away, I would take that pretty seriously.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That was <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://conversationswithtyler.com/episodes/nate-silver-2/\" target=\"_blank\">from my Nate Silver CWTtaped on July 22, 2024</a>.  We just taped a new episode today…</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/07/that-was-then-this-is-now-ai-edition.html\">That was then, this is now, AI edition</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/922091549/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/922091549/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/922091549/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/922091549/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/922091549/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></